{"repositoryId":1424322403,"availability":"available","full":"Toolrank/bookdesk-demo","name":"bookdesk-demo","description":"BookDesk: installable booking & client manager PWA for small service businesses. Sample software by ToolRank Studio.","category":"Business","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-10-18T11:58:27Z","updated":"2026-10-18T12:00:11Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://toolrank.github.io/bookdesk-demo/","topics":["booking-system","javascript","offline-first","pwa","small-business"],"demo":"https://toolrank.github.io/bookdesk-demo/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:12.147Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:12.147Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T11:49:12.147Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T11:49:12.147Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A booking and client manager for small service businesses such as salons, tutors, music teachers and trades.","BookDesk is an installable Progressive Web App. It installs on desktop and phone like regular software, works offline, and keeps all data on the user's own device. There is no backend, no account and no running cost.","Sample software by ToolRank Studio, Sydney. ToolRank builds websites, web apps and custom business software."],"features":["Calendar: week and day views, opening hours shading, current time line, click any empty slot to book, click a booking to edit or delete it","Clash and hours warnings: flags overlapping bookings and bookings outside opening hours","Clients: name, phone, email and notes, booking history, total paid, next booking, quick filter","Services: price, duration and calendar colour","Dashboard: today's bookings, this week's revenue (calculated from your own bookings, excluding cancellations), revenue by day, upcoming bookings"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Toolrank/bookdesk-demo/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"10cd02bff0903d8b501bbc42106d13ec86101f514055b77bda08